gCommand","messageBody":"Added Dog package to model dogs with the fields, name, breed and size.\nAdded AddDogCommand to allow users to add a dog.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":340,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"aee074676fd975c613e6633f2baf0ea03d1994b0","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"324023e6d3c55452a8ee37349f16d8c76cb62388","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #64 from lilosy/branch-add-customer","messageBody":"Add Customer package and AddCustomerCommand","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a22e48f297529e0b6bc1fcbd00d8eec9753363e1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add initial dog command model support","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":207,"deletions":12}}},{"hash":"fc80547976c5a8d1f1f3171e8822d08f9493d4ab","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add dog creation and ID persistence","messageBody":"Dog records need a command flow, stable identity, and storage support for the daycare feature. Without persistent IDs, deleted dog IDs could be reused after restarting the application.\n\nAdd dog parsing and execution, assign IDs through AddressBook, serialize dogs and the next unused ID, and validate duplicate persisted IDs. Add parser and model tests for dog creation and ID behavior.\n\nKeep dog IDs separate from names so multiple dogs may share a name while retaining distinct identities. Verify the changes with the full Gradle test suite.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":230,"deletions":46},"test-code":{"insertions":66,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"69bc96d340bb5175b700e0148b4fb047eb0786b7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix dog Checkstyle violations","messageBody":"Dog-related files contain formatting and documentation violations that fail the repository Checkstyle task.\n\nCorrect import ordering and spacing, add parser utility Javadocs, and reorder dog test imports so the dog changes satisfy Checkstyle without modifying customer code.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":20,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"dc82655620e66e4a0c5fea3bb55cea2cc656a7c1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add unique dog collection","messageBody":"Dog records need collection-level identity checks so loading and future dog commands can reject duplicate persistent IDs.\n\nAdd UniqueDogList and DuplicateDogException, route AddressBook dog storage through the unique collection, and test duplicate IDs and unassigned dogs.\n\nKeep ID generation in AddressBook while letting the collection enforce uniqueness.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":93,"deletions":13},"test-code":{"insertions":39,"deletions":0}}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"Kenneth-Chia":{"docs":154,"functional-code":553,"test-code":909},"lilosy":{"docs":52,"functional-code":527,"test-code":338},"XanderGoh":{"docs":182,"functional-code":66,"test-code":43},"its-shoutime":{"docs":12,"functional-code":526,"test-code":59},"Umaiza-15":{"docs":4,"functional-code":811,"test-code":105}},"authorContributionVariance":{"Kenneth-Chia":61167.164,"lilosy":22435.076,"XanderGoh":2173.035,"its-shoutime":15469.063,"Umaiza-15":21777.525},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"Kenneth-Chia":"CS2103T-T15-4 KENN.. JIE","lilosy":"CS2103T-T15-4 ASEE..NATH","XanderGoh":"CS2103T-T15-4 GOH ..NDER","its-shoutime":"CS2103T-T15-4 CHEN..U\u0027AN","Umaiza-15":"CS2103T-T15-4 UMAI..AIZA"}}
